===Etymology===
{{bf|en|walleyed}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|walleye|n|225310|March 2022}}</ref>

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|walleye}}

# {{lb|en|plural "walleyes"}} One or a pair of sideways-looking misaligned [[eye]]s.
# {{lb|en|plural "walleyes"}} An unusually [[pale]] eye.
# {{lb|en|plural "walleye" or "walleyes"}} A species of [[gamefish]], {{taxlink|Sander vitreus|species}}, native to the Northern U.S. and Canada with pale, reflective eyes.

